    "title": "Canadian ICT Work Permit Research Synthesis",
    "content": "This plan synthesizes existing research on Canadian Intra-Company Transfer (ICT) work permit pitfalls, refusal reasons, and expert tips from two parallel streams: (1) legal/professional sources (immigration lawyer blogs, government guidelines, KPMG alerts) and (2) community/applicant sources (canadavisa.com forums, Reddit, Times of India reports on Indian applicant experiences). The October 2024 guideline changes introduced significant new requirements around physical premises, specialized knowledge thresholds, and multinational corporation status that must be highlighted. The final synthesis combines legal expertise with ground-level applicant experiences to provide actionable insights.",
