        {"goal": "Analyze legal and professional sources for ICT work permit pitfalls, refusal reasons, and expert tips. Process sources including Gowling WLG, Garfinkel Immigration, Green and Spiegel, Ackah Law, BW Immigration, VisaServe, KPMG Flash Alerts, and the October 2024 IRCC guideline changes. Extract: (a) major refusal reasons (inadequate documentation, ineligible job offers, inadmissibility, company relationship proof), (b) new 2024 requirements (physical premises, specialized knowledge >=2 years, significant benefit to Canada, role continuity), (c) expert tips from lawyers on application preparation.", "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent", "depends_on": []},
